{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>I am YHWH.</b> The sustainer of existence — not merely its cause, but also its sustainer, for existing things have no being or persistence apart from what I bestow upon them, as it says: וְאַתָּה מְחַיֶּה אֶת כֻּלָּם (Nehemiah 9:6). From this it follows that no existent has persistence of being apart from My will."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:32.406618304Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}